NPU Simulator Implementation Plan
Project Summary
Build a single-cycle NPU simulator in C++ that:

Assembles .asm files with custom NPU instructions + RV32I subset
Executes programs through IF → ID → EX → MEM → WB stages (single-cycle)
Outputs terminal traces + JSON/CSV logs
Includes 3 neural network demos (Dense, MLP, RNN)
Is structured for future pipelined extension
