Neural Network Demos
Demo 1: Single Dense Layer (dense_layer.asm)
Operation: output = ReLU(W * input)
Size: 4x4 weight matrix, 4-element vectors
Instructions: ~15 lines
Demo 2: 2-Layer MLP (mlp_2layer.asm)
Architecture: Input(4) → Hidden(4) → Output(4)
Operations: Two matrix-vector multiplies + ReLU + ARGMAX
Instructions: ~35 lines
Demo 3: Simple RNN (simple_rnn.asm)
Operation: h_new = ReLU(W_h * h_old + W_x * x_input)
Demonstrates: State accumulation across "timesteps"
Instructions: ~25 lines
