Future Pipelining Extension
The folder structure and CPUBase interface allow easy addition of PipelinedCPU:

class PipelinedCPU : public CPUBase {
    // Pipeline registers
    IF_ID_Reg if_id;
    ID_EX_Reg id_ex;
    EX_MEM_Reg ex_mem;
    MEM_WB_Reg mem_wb;
    
    // Hazard detection
    HazardUnit hazardUnit;
    ForwardingUnit forwardingUnit;
    
    void step() override {
        // Each stage reads from previous pipeline register
        // and writes to next pipeline register
        WB();  MEM();  EX();  ID();  IF();
    }
};
The single-cycle implementation will use the same Decoder, Memory, RegisterFile, ALU, and NPUUnit classes.

